  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the eighth layer of Crazed Demon Cave, Lady White Rabbit takes out seven rank eight Immortal Gu Houses from her immortal aperture, naming Dragon Soul Dark Castle with Rising Cloud City, Profound Frost House, Unbreakable Golden Fortress, Red River Pavilion, Red Heavenly Altar, and Scarlet Palace. Fang Yuan built the set after refining Immortal Gu through He Chun Qiu and Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool so subordinates could fight when he could not use his full strength in that layer. The houses are modified on the basis of Cloud City, Dark Flow Giant City, Profound Ice House, Unbreakable Iron Fortress, Blood River Chariot, Nightmare Castle, Green Wave Pavilion, Weaving Cocoon Manor, Golden Altar, and other Immortal Gu Houses, treated as partial innovations.",
      "chapters": [
        2178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
